So I was always been self-conscious about myself as soon as women came into my life, one of the first looksmaxx traits I learnt by myself like keeping my teeth in a ideal bite (since I have an overbite and having it closed makes my face shorter, rounder and narrows and pushes my chin back, and jaw to my ears.) I then had learned about correct tongue posture and correct swallowing at its many benefits for breathing,sleeping,looks and aesthetics, and preventing the crowding of teeth.

 In this first photo I was around 13, I had learnt proper mouth and tongue posture, I was only "mewing" with a slight pressure as I realized that it tightened under my neck before I even heard about mike mew.

 Me at 13, before acknowledgment of correct tongue posture and shit.

